>>>>>>>>
>>>>>>>> [2] https://wiki.openjdk.org/display/crac
>>>>>>>>
>>>>>>>> [3] https://github.com/openjdk/crac
>>>>>>>>
>>>>>>>> [4] https://github.com/CRaC/org.crac
>>>>>>>>
>>>>>>>> [5] https://quarkus.io/quarkus-workshops/super-heroes/
