s KIP proposes an alternative to consumer groups to enable cooperative cons=
umption by consumers without partition assignment. You end up with queue se=
mantics on top of regular Kafka topics, with per-message acknowledgement an=
d automatic handling of messages which repeatedly fail to be processed.=0A=
