> https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-926%3A+introducing+=
acks%3Dmin.insync.replicas+config
> &gt
> <https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-926%3A+introducing=
+acks%3Dmin.insync.replicas+config&gt>;
> &gt; &gt;
> &gt; &gt; &gt; Any feedback is welcome.
> &gt; &gt; &gt;
> &gt; &gt; &gt; Thank you.
> &gt; &gt; &gt; Luke
