Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit
X-JIRA-FingerPrint: 30527f35849b9dde25b450d4833f0394

Akhilesh Chaganti created KAFKA-15007:
-----------------------------------------

             Summary: MV is not set correctly in the MetadataPropagator in migration.
                 Key: KAFKA-15007
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-15007
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
            Reporter: Akhilesh Chaganti


MV changes are not set in propagator unless we're in DUAL_WRITE mode. But we do this, we'll skip any known MV changes. The propagator should always know the correct MV so that it sends correct UMR and LISR during DUAL_WRITE.



--
