To resolve the issue, we need to add the below line when in the JsonSeriali=
zer.java and JsonDeserializer.java classes.
{code:java}
objectMapper.enable(JsonReadFeature.ALLOWLEADINGZEROSFORNUMBERS.mappedFeatu=
re()); {code}
Attaching a patch file showing the changes here.=C2=A0

=C2=A0



