Kafka. This KIP proposes an alternative to consumer groups to enable =
cooperative consumption by consumers without partition assignment. You =
end up with queue semantics on top of regular Kafka topics, with =
per-message acknowledgement and automatic handling of messages which =
repeatedly fail to be processed.
>>>=20
>>> =
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-932%3A+Queues+for+Ka=
fka
>>>=20
>>> Please take a look and let me know what you think.
>>>=20
>>> Thanks.
>>> Andrew
>>=20
>=20

